msgid ""
"Effortlessly sync your WooCommerce data with Google Sheets. Available "
"options include Orders, Products, Product Variations, Customers, Coupons, "
"and Subscriptions. Select only the sync types that best suit your needs. "
"This ensures seamless integration and real-time updates for efficient data "
"management."
