"single click. This ensures that your Google Sheet stays up-to-date with the "
"latest order information, based on your configuration done above, providing "
"you with real-time insights and streamlined data management. Optimize your "
"workflow with the convenience of synchronized orders."
msgstr ""
"Initiate the synchronization of your WooCommerce orders seamlessly with a "
"single click. This ensures that your Google Sheet stays up-to-date with the "
"latest order information, based on your configuration done above, providing "
